  message: "Fixed in PR #3661. JS/TS dataflow yaml extended with: (1) returns: positional rules for return_statement / throw_statement / yield_expression / await_expression (_default: read); (2) update_expression rule (a++/--a mutates); (3) expanded library_patterns vocabulary with in-place mutators (.sort/.reverse/.fill/.copyWithin), ORM verbs (.save/.persist/.insert/.update/.replace/.assign), pub-sub (.emit/.publish/.send/.dispatch/.next/.complete/.error), Promise readers (.subscribe/.observe/.then/.catch/.finally), iteration readers (.map/.filter/.reduce/.forEach/.every/.some/.values/.keys/.entries), additional read verbs (.fetch/.load/.query/.lookup/.findOne/.findMany/.exec/.toString/.toJSON). +8 property tests; one test documents a known _build_line_index limitation with const-declarator + await + call (out of scope, can be a separate WI if bakeoff signal warrants)."  # 631e
